This crate, and the renderer in crates/hyprforge-media/src/model/, are
carried from view3d (https://github.com/adamrpostjr/view3d) into Hyprforge.
view3d is a re-implementation of fstl (https://github.com/fstl-app/fstl).
fstl ships no LICENSE file; its README states these same MIT terms under
"Copyright (c) 2014-2017 Matthew Keeter". Portions of this project are
translations of that source and remain subject to that license, in
particular:

  * the fragment shaders in crates/hyprforge-media/src/model/scene.wgsl, ported from
    fstl's gl/mesh.frag, gl/mesh_light.frag, gl/mesh_surfaceangle.frag and
    gl/quad.frag, including their color constants;
  * the camera, projection and viewpoint math in src/camera.rs (this crate), ported from
    fstl's src/canvas.cpp;
  * the axis and axis-flower geometry in
    crates/hyprforge-media/src/model/render.rs, ported from
    fstl's src/axis.cpp and src/backdrop.cpp.

The mesh-light and surface-angle shaders postdate fstl's 2014-2017 copyright
line and appear to come from later contributors, so credit for them belongs
to the fstl project as a whole.

